// Sheet: control zone -- restrains (Dexterity save) AND counts as difficult
// terrain. Combines this batch's two already-shipped single-rider precedents
// directly: `Rooted` (conjuration/entangle.ron) for the restrain, and
// `DifficultTerrain` (conjuration/grease.ron, transmutation/plant_growth.ron)
// for the "choking their movement" clinging-strands half -- `StaticAura`'s
// `auras:` field is a `Vec<AuraBuffConstructor>`, so both apply
// simultaneously from the same zone, not a new mechanic. The sheet's
// "flammable, ignites if touched by flame" rider has no fire-interaction
// primitive and is dropped. `StaticAura` always places the zone at the
// caster's own position (no aimed placement exists,
// common/src/states/static_aura.rs) -- the sheet's 18 m cast range isn't
// mechanically expressed, same simplification as entangle/fog_cloud/grease.
// Sheet footprint is a 6 m cube; `range` (a radius) reuses the raw 6.0
// number directly, the same cube-as-radius approximation entangle.ron's own
// `range: 6.0` already ships with for its Sphere r6 footprint.
StaticAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.6,
    cast_duration: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    energy_cost: 60.0,
    targets: OutOfGroup,
    auras: [
        (kind: Rooted, strength: 1.0, duration: Some(2), category: Some(Magical)),
        (kind: DifficultTerrain, strength: 0.5, duration: Some(2), category: Some(Magical)),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(20.0),
    range: 6.0,
    sprite_info: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
